WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:27.130
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:27.400 --> 01:34.940
[The Great Long March]

3
01:35.400 --> 01:37.650
[Episode 36]

4
01:40.650 --> 01:42.840
The enemy's newspaper just published

5
01:43.310 --> 01:45.400
that a few days ago, the Central Red Army

6
01:45.400 --> 01:47.400
successfully crossed the natural barrier of the Dadu River,

7
01:47.400 --> 01:49.000
and will join forces with us soon.

8
01:49.000 --> 01:49.710
Good.

9
01:50.120 --> 01:51.509
Great, that's wonderful!

10
01:51.509 --> 01:53.430
We should send someone to meet them.

11
01:52.920 --> 01:55.300
[Zhang Guotao, Member of the Standing Committee of the Politburo of the CPC Central Committee; Chairman of the Northwest Revolutionary Military Commission]

12
01:54.860 --> 01:55.860
Xiangqian.

13
01:57.000 --> 01:58.920
We are on the same page this time.

14
01:59.950 --> 02:00.920
I have decided

15
02:01.140 --> 02:03.270
to send Comrades Li Xiannian and He Wei

16
02:03.560 --> 02:04.710
to lead the vanguard

17
02:04.790 --> 02:06.310
west to the Xiaojinchuan area

18
02:06.310 --> 02:07.970
to clear out the enemies there

19
02:08.030 --> 02:11.870
and to support and welcome the 300,000-strong Central Red Army.

20
02:12.120 --> 02:14.250
We guarantee to complete the mission.

21
02:14.750 --> 02:15.800
Chairman.

22
02:17.600 --> 02:19.630
The cadres of the Northwest Federal Government have arrived.

23
02:17.650 --> 02:19.430
[Huang Chao, Secretary-General of the Northwest Revolutionary Military Commission and the Sichuan-Shaanxi Provincial Soviet Government]

24
02:19.710 --> 02:20.560
They are all waiting for you.

25
02:20.560 --> 02:21.079
Okay.

26
02:22.130 --> 02:23.480
Let's go and take a look.

27
02:25.310 --> 02:25.950
Xiangqian.

28
02:25.950 --> 02:26.670
Xiannian.

29
02:26.579 --> 02:28.440
[Chen Changhao, Political Commissar of the 4th Front Army]

30
02:26.810 --> 02:28.530
I'll leave the meeting arrangements to you two.

31
02:28.530 --> 02:29.020
Okay.

32
02:29.230 --> 02:30.490
Political Commissar.

33
02:31.150 --> 02:32.650
300,000 troops in the Central Red Army?

34
02:32.650 --> 02:33.870
Are there really that many?

35
02:33.870 --> 02:34.860
Even if there aren't 300,000,

36
02:34.860 --> 02:36.320
the number won't be small.

37
02:36.600 --> 02:38.510
This claim helps boost morale.

38
02:43.320 --> 02:44.760
Come on, let's go.

39
02:46.390 --> 02:46.850
Come on.

40
02:46.860 --> 02:49.950
[Welcome the 300,000 Central Red Army]

41
02:52.010 --> 02:52.520
Slow down.

42
02:52.520 --> 02:53.040
Okay.

43
02:55.490 --> 02:56.750
Commander-in-Chief.

44
02:57.079 --> 02:58.829
Are we setting up a federal government here

45
02:58.829 --> 03:00.350
to establish a base

46
03:00.480 --> 03:01.730
and put down roots?

47
03:01.020 --> 03:03.460
[Xu Xiangqian, Commander-in-Chief of the 4th Front Army]

48
03:04.400 --> 03:05.680
What do you think?

49
03:06.000 --> 03:08.030
This area is sparsely populated

50
03:08.030 --> 03:09.080
and short of food.

51
03:09.100 --> 03:11.000
It's not suitable for a large army to stay for long.

52
03:11.000 --> 03:11.910
Moreover,

53
03:11.960 --> 03:12.870
the Kuomintang is constantly

54
03:12.870 --> 03:15.140
building fortresses in the north and east,

55
03:15.140 --> 03:16.800
which is extremely disadvantageous to us.

56
03:16.800 --> 03:17.310
I think

57
03:17.550 --> 03:19.960
the original Sichuan-Shaanxi-Gansu plan is better.

58
03:19.960 --> 03:21.540
After the two main front armies join forces,

59
03:21.540 --> 03:23.500
marching north to wipe out a part of Hu Zongnan's troops

60
03:23.500 --> 03:25.130
and establishing a base area in Sichuan, Shaanxi, and Gansu

61
03:25.130 --> 03:26.200
is very promising.

62
03:27.370 --> 03:30.260
Let's hope the two armies can successfully join forces.

63
03:30.260 --> 03:30.980
Xiannian.

64
03:31.350 --> 03:33.090
After you meet the leaders of the CPC Central Committee,

65
03:33.090 --> 03:34.380
you must truthfully report

66
03:34.380 --> 03:35.460
the situation of the 4th Front Army.

67
03:35.460 --> 03:36.170
In addition,

68
03:36.170 --> 03:38.560
you should also deeply understand their situation.

69
03:38.560 --> 03:40.560
I believe the CPC Central Committee

70
03:41.130 --> 03:42.700
will make the right decision.

71
03:42.700 --> 03:43.370
Understood.

72
03:43.370 --> 03:45.770
By the way, which unit will be the vanguard?

73
03:46.329 --> 03:47.180
We plan to send

74
03:47.329 --> 03:49.050
Comrade Han Dongshan, commander of the 25th Division,

75
03:49.050 --> 03:51.020
to lead the 74th Regiment as the vanguard.

76
03:51.020 --> 03:52.210
They will set off from Wenchuan

77
03:52.210 --> 03:54.140
to open up a route to Maogong first,

78
03:54.490 --> 03:55.900
and other troops will follow.

79
03:55.900 --> 03:57.210
Good. Very good.

80
03:57.610 --> 03:58.740
After I return to Lifan,

81
03:58.740 --> 04:00.900
I will immediately contact the comrades of the Sichuan-Shaanxi Provincial Party Committee

82
04:00.900 --> 04:03.490
and ask them to form a task force to go to Maogong

83
04:03.490 --> 04:04.740
to ensure the needs of the Central Committee.

84
04:04.740 --> 04:05.460
Okay.

85
04:08.260 --> 04:08.900
Look.

86
04:09.090 --> 04:10.420
Can't you see it's crooked here?

87
04:10.110 --> 04:13.570
[Establishment of the Northwest Federal Government of the Chinese Soviet Republic]

88
04:10.740 --> 04:11.300
Make this side higher.

89
04:11.300 --> 04:12.020
I'll do it.

90
04:19.290 --> 04:19.940
Okay.

91
04:20.140 --> 04:21.529
It fits. This works.

92
04:22.530 --> 04:23.610
Tie it tightly.

93
04:32.140 --> 04:33.770
According to superior orders,

94
04:33.770 --> 04:35.500
the vanguard of the 4th Front Army,

95
04:35.500 --> 04:38.330
the 74th Regiment of the 25th Division of the 9th Red Army,

96
04:38.330 --> 04:41.130
marched west from the Wenchuan area day and night,

97
04:41.500 --> 04:43.210
crossed the Hongqiao Snow Mountain,

98
04:43.210 --> 04:45.700
went through more than 20 battles of various sizes,

99
04:45.700 --> 04:47.409
and successively occupied Lianghekou,

100
04:47.409 --> 04:48.820
Fubian, and Maogong.

101
04:49.290 --> 04:50.770
On June 9th,

102
04:50.770 --> 04:52.260
together with the 80th Regiment of the 27th Red Division

103
04:52.260 --> 04:54.540
coming from the direction of Weizhou,

104
04:54.770 --> 04:57.700
they occupied Dawei Town at the northern foot of Jiajin Mountain,

105
04:57.700 --> 05:00.880
successfully completing the task of opening the channel

106
05:00.880 --> 05:03.210
for the two main Red Armies to join forces.

107
05:03.680 --> 05:13.460
[Northern Foothills of Mount Jiajin, Mopanshi, Sichuan]

108
05:20.870 --> 05:22.030
[Yang Chengwu, Political Commissar of the 4th Regiment]

109
05:22.090 --> 05:24.000
[Huang Kaixiang, Commander of the 4th Regiment]

110
05:24.020 --> 05:25.910
[Mao Zhenhua, Company Commander of the 3rd Company, 1st Battalion, 4th Regiment]

111
05:28.060 --> 05:29.460
The bugle call is wrong.

112
05:31.240 --> 05:32.370
Prepare for battle!

113
05:35.530 --> 05:36.810
Don't shoot yet!

114
05:38.260 --> 05:39.620
Regiment Commander, Political Commissar.

115
05:39.620 --> 05:40.659
What are we waiting for?

116
05:40.659 --> 05:41.900
The troops here are either the Kuomintang army

117
05:41.900 --> 05:42.850
or reactionary armed forces.

118
05:42.850 --> 05:44.450
Don't talk. Shut your mouth.

119
05:47.580 --> 05:50.850
We are the Red Army. Who are you?

120
05:52.820 --> 05:54.770
We are the Red Army.

121
05:55.140 --> 05:57.050
Who are you?

122
05:57.380 --> 05:58.710
What are they shouting?

123
05:58.820 --> 05:59.700
I didn't hear clearly.

124
05:59.700 --> 06:00.460
Regiment Commander,

125
06:00.460 --> 06:01.700
they shouted that they are the Red Army.

126
06:01.700 --> 06:03.160
It sounds like it to me too.

127
06:04.900 --> 06:09.730
♪ August osmanthus blooms across the land ♪

128
06:09.970 --> 06:14.480
♪ Bright red flags rise high across the land ♪

129
06:12.140 --> 06:13.290
Regiment Commander,

130
06:13.290 --> 06:15.020
this song sounds a bit familiar.

131
06:15.020 --> 06:17.530
I heard this song at the Workers, Peasants and Soldiers Congress.

132
06:17.530 --> 06:19.500
This is a song from the Hubei-Henan-Anhui Soviet Area.

133
06:19.500 --> 06:21.320
Hubei-Henan-Anhui Soviet Area?

134
06:21.320 --> 06:22.730
That's the 4th Front Army.

135
06:22.730 --> 06:24.590
Aren't they in the Min River area?

136
06:25.070 --> 06:26.290
How did they get here?

137
06:28.260 --> 06:29.140
Comrades,

138
06:29.850 --> 06:30.730
let's also sing

139
06:30.730 --> 06:32.620
"To Be a Soldier, Join the Red Army."

140
06:32.620 --> 06:34.330
Ready, sing.

141
06:34.970 --> 06:37.040
♪ To be a soldier, join the Red Army ♪

142
06:37.060 --> 06:39.020
♪ Workers and peasants welcome us everywhere ♪

143
06:39.140 --> 06:41.170
♪ Officers and soldiers stand as equals ♪

144
06:41.170 --> 06:43.140
♪ No one oppresses anyone else ♪

145
06:43.210 --> 06:45.210
♪ To be a soldier, join the Red Army ♪

146
06:45.210 --> 06:47.140
♪ Workers and peasants unite to kill the enemy ♪

147
06:47.290 --> 06:49.210
♪ Compradors, gentry, and landlords ♪

148
06:49.380 --> 06:51.290
♪ We fight them without mercy ♪

149
06:51.409 --> 06:53.330
♪ To be a soldier, join the Red Army ♪

150
06:53.409 --> 06:55.330
♪ Join the Red Army ♪

151
06:55.380 --> 06:57.290
♪ After retirement, a soldier never worries about making a living ♪

152
06:57.409 --> 06:59.330
♪ Never worries about making a living ♪

153
06:59.460 --> 07:01.290
♪ Those who can work will find a job ♪

154
07:01.290 --> 07:03.140
♪ Will find a job ♪

155
07:03.170 --> 07:05.020
♪ Lanterns and ribbons adorn the streets ♪

156
07:05.020 --> 07:06.850
♪ Lanterns and ribbons adorn the streets ♪

157
07:07.090 --> 07:10.970
♪ A brilliant new world shines before our eyes ♪

158
07:11.060 --> 07:14.970
♪ The Red Army marches with pride ♪

159
07:15.090 --> 07:18.820
♪ Brave and victorious in every fight ♪

160
07:19.170 --> 07:21.210
♪ Officers and soldiers stand as equals ♪

161
07:21.210 --> 07:23.170
♪ No one oppresses anyone else ♪

162
07:23.410 --> 07:25.330
♪ To be a soldier, join the Red Army ♪

163
07:25.330 --> 07:27.260
♪ Workers and peasants unite to kill the enemy ♪

164
07:27.260 --> 07:30.850
♪ A red flag waves up high ♪

165
07:31.260 --> 07:35.090
♪ The Red Army's ranks will multiply ♪

166
07:35.090 --> 07:37.020
♪ Defend the new workers' and peasants' regime ♪

167
07:37.020 --> 07:39.060
♪ Lead the people in revolution's dream ♪

168
07:39.060 --> 07:42.850
♪ Red soldiers bring us honor and pride ♪

169
07:43.060 --> 07:47.060
♪ A red flag waves up high ♪

170
07:47.090 --> 07:50.940
♪ The Red Army's ranks will multiply ♪

171
07:51.090 --> 07:53.020
♪ Dear fellow workers ♪

172
07:53.020 --> 07:54.900
♪ Dear fellow peasants ♪

173
07:54.900 --> 07:58.530
♪ Take up arms and join the Red Army ♪

174
08:09.550 --> 08:12.620
Are you the Central Red Army?

175
08:12.970 --> 08:14.460
We are from the 1st Red Army Corps.

176
08:14.460 --> 08:15.940
Are you the 4th Front Army?

177
08:16.060 --> 08:17.460
Put the gun down.

178
08:17.900 --> 08:18.650
Put the gun down.

179
08:18.650 --> 08:20.170
Thank God.

180
08:20.330 --> 08:22.700
We finally see you.

181
08:22.910 --> 08:23.670
Comrades.

182
08:51.380 --> 08:55.240
[The 4th Front Army Forward Command, Lifan (present-day Li County), Sichuan]

183
08:54.050 --> 08:55.910
What are you writing, Xiangqian?

184
08:56.500 --> 08:58.620
This is a letter I'm drafting

185
08:58.690 --> 09:00.860
to Chairman Mao, Vice Chairman Zhou,

186
09:01.290 --> 09:02.980
and Commander-in-Chief Zhu.

187
09:03.410 --> 09:04.200
It's mainly

188
09:04.550 --> 09:06.740
to brief the Central Revolutionary Military Commission

189
09:06.740 --> 09:08.010
on the current enemy situation

190
09:08.010 --> 09:09.290
and some basic information

191
09:09.290 --> 09:10.690
about our 4th Front Army.

192
09:10.770 --> 09:11.300
Here.

193
09:12.050 --> 09:12.600
Take a look.

194
09:12.600 --> 09:13.080
Okay.

195
09:16.170 --> 09:17.450
The 4th Front Army

196
09:17.570 --> 09:20.500
and tens of millions of workers and peasants in northwest Sichuan,

197
09:20.500 --> 09:22.160
welcome our ever-victorious

198
09:22.390 --> 09:23.900
Central Western Expeditionary Army

199
09:23.900 --> 09:26.610
with extreme enthusiasm.

200
09:27.630 --> 09:29.230
Good. Well written.

201
09:29.640 --> 09:30.590
No problem.

202
09:32.900 --> 09:34.560
After Chairman Zhang agrees,

203
09:34.650 --> 09:36.340
I'll send someone to deliver this letter, supplies,

204
09:36.340 --> 09:38.500
and most importantly, military maps,

205
09:38.730 --> 09:40.260
to the central leaders.

206
09:40.500 --> 09:41.550
Comrade Xiangqian,

207
09:41.550 --> 09:43.430
you really think of everything.

208
09:44.310 --> 09:46.640
Just following Chairman Zhang's orders.

209
09:49.050 --> 09:49.980
I heard

210
09:50.580 --> 09:53.530
the Central Red Army has reached the southern foot of Jiajin Mountain

211
09:53.530 --> 09:54.980
and is preparing to cross the snow mountain.

212
09:54.980 --> 09:57.650
Chairman Zhang has already sent them a telegram

213
09:57.740 --> 09:59.650
of support on behalf of the 4th Front Army.

214
09:59.650 --> 10:00.260
Great.

215
10:01.100 --> 10:01.980
It hasn't been easy.

216
10:01.980 --> 10:02.780
Almost there.

217
10:03.620 --> 10:04.750
It hasn't been easy.

218
10:06.050 --> 10:11.690
[Dawi Town, Maogong County (present-day Xiaojin County), Sichuan]

219
10:08.290 --> 10:10.370
Division Commander! Division Commander!

220
10:10.370 --> 10:12.370
Division Commander! They are here!

221
10:12.620 --> 10:13.530
What's here?

222
10:13.770 --> 10:14.290
The enemy?

223
10:14.290 --> 10:15.050
No, no, no.

224
10:15.140 --> 10:16.340
The phone is ringing.

225
10:16.870 --> 10:19.410
[Han Dongshan, Commander of the 25th Division, 9th Army Corps, 4th Front Army]

226
10:17.260 --> 10:18.740
You are always so clumsy.

227
10:18.770 --> 10:19.060
Yes.

228
10:19.090 --> 10:20.690
What phone call? Whose call?

229
10:20.690 --> 10:22.500
It's a call from the 74th Regiment.

230
10:22.500 --> 10:23.340
They are at Mopanshi,

231
10:23.340 --> 10:27.470
and have joined forces with the vanguard regiment of the Central Red Army!

232
10:34.340 --> 10:35.930
Connect me to Commander-in-Chief Xu.

233
10:35.930 --> 10:36.720
Reporting, Division Commander,

234
10:36.720 --> 10:39.380
we can't get through to Commander-in-Chief Xu.

235
10:41.170 --> 10:41.620
Send a telegram.

236
10:41.620 --> 10:42.050
Yes.

237
10:42.220 --> 10:43.050
Send a telegram to Chairman Zhang.

238
10:43.050 --> 10:43.450
Yes.

239
10:43.900 --> 10:45.500
And to Commander-in-Chief Xu, and Political Commissar Chen.

240
10:45.500 --> 10:45.810
Okay.

241
10:45.810 --> 10:47.670
Tell them this good news quickly.

242
10:47.690 --> 10:47.980
Yes!

243
10:47.980 --> 10:48.640
Go quickly.

244
10:50.620 --> 10:51.130
Staff Officer Li.

245
10:51.130 --> 10:52.660
Division Commander, here!

246
10:53.290 --> 10:55.050
Allocate another 30 loads of grain.

247
10:55.050 --> 10:56.740
Make sure our comrades from the Central Red Army

248
10:56.740 --> 10:58.470
have plenty to eat and eat well.

249
10:58.530 --> 10:59.590
Okay, understood.

250
11:04.740 --> 11:09.600
[Southern Foothills of Mount Jiajin, Sichuan]

251
11:06.580 --> 11:07.940
Comrades, look up.

252
11:08.220 --> 11:09.760
The snow-covered mountain lies ahead.

253
11:09.760 --> 11:11.220
It's high, buried in snow, with no path to follow.

254
11:11.220 --> 11:12.690
The wind cuts to the bone.

255
11:12.900 --> 11:14.430
Comrades, don't be afraid.

256
11:14.500 --> 11:15.500
Relax your minds.

257
11:15.570 --> 11:17.380
Listen to me talk about some tips.

258
