313
12:53.930 --> 12:56.770
and all commanders and fighters of the Central Red Army.

314
12:56.770 --> 12:58.860
The victorious telegram of the Maogong meeting has arrived,

315
12:58.860 --> 13:00.410
and the whole army is rejoicing.

316
13:00.410 --> 13:02.560
You have victoriously fought over a thousand miles,

317
13:02.560 --> 13:03.530
sweeping across the southwest.

318
13:03.530 --> 13:05.320
For the anti-imperialist Soviet movement

319
13:05.320 --> 13:07.880
and the sacred national revolutionary war,

320
13:08.260 --> 13:11.530
you have gone through long and arduous struggles,

321
13:11.830 --> 13:14.810
bringing about the meeting of the main Red Army today,

322
13:14.810 --> 13:16.650
and laying the most favorable

323
13:16.740 --> 13:19.860
groundwork for bringing the Northwest under the Red banner.

324
13:19.860 --> 13:20.770
From now on, we and you,

325
13:20.770 --> 13:23.740
under the unified command of the Communist Party of China,

326
13:23.740 --> 13:27.170
will jointly strive for the victory of the Northwest Revolution

327
13:27.170 --> 13:29.930
and ultimately establish a new Soviet China.

328
13:30.260 --> 13:32.860
To Zhang Guotao, Chen Changhao, Xu Xiangqian,

329
13:32.930 --> 13:35.930
and all commanders and fighters of the 4th Front Army.

330
13:37.340 --> 13:39.740
We've been on the move since leaving Jiangxi,

331
13:39.740 --> 13:41.380
through over 200 days and

332
13:41.650 --> 13:44.140
more than 10,000 li of arduous marches and battles.

333
13:44.140 --> 13:46.570
We've endured enemy encirclements, blockades,

334
13:46.570 --> 13:48.110
treacherous terrain, and desperate situations,

335
13:48.110 --> 13:48.770
yet we haven't seen a single sign

336
13:48.770 --> 13:50.220
of our comrades in the other units.

337
13:50.220 --> 13:51.620
Now our brothers are just

338
13:51.770 --> 13:53.230
beyond those snow-covered mountains,

339
13:53.230 --> 13:54.490
right before our eyes.

340
13:56.100 --> 13:59.410
We should immediately, in the name of the Central Revolutionary Military Commission

341
13:59.410 --> 14:01.900
and all commanders and fighters of the Central Red Army,

342
14:01.900 --> 14:04.050
send a reply telegram to the 4th Front Army,

343
14:04.050 --> 14:05.080
expressing our joy

344
14:05.080 --> 14:07.950
and anticipation at our victorious reunion.

345
14:08.900 --> 14:09.740
Besides,

346
14:09.900 --> 14:10.900
we should also,

347
14:11.140 --> 14:13.740
in the name of the CPC Central Committee and the Central Revolutionary Military Commission,

348
14:13.740 --> 14:15.970
send a telegram to Comrades Zhang, Chen, and Xu,

349
14:15.970 --> 14:19.500
so we can reach a consensus with the 4th Front Army

350
14:19.690 --> 14:22.450
on our overall strategy after the two armies unite.

351
14:22.450 --> 14:23.170
I agree.

352
14:24.500 --> 14:26.990
When it comes to strategy, we still have to listen to Mao.

353
14:26.990 --> 14:27.540
Yes.

354
14:30.340 --> 14:33.650
This is a newspaper I requested

355
14:33.930 --> 14:35.380
from our publicity department.

356
14:35.380 --> 14:37.460
It's an issue of Red China from three years ago.

357
14:37.460 --> 14:38.720
Take a look, everyone,

358
14:38.810 --> 14:40.610
and see if you still remember it.

359
14:42.500 --> 14:44.600
Provisional Central Government of

360
14:44.620 --> 14:46.290
the Chinese Soviet Republic's Declaration

361
14:46.290 --> 14:48.570
of War Against Japan.

362
14:48.650 --> 14:50.650
This was drafted by Comrade Zedong.

363
14:50.690 --> 14:52.500
It was issued in Ruijin

364
14:52.530 --> 14:53.620
on April 15, 1932,

365
14:53.770 --> 14:55.100
and published in this issue

366
14:55.100 --> 14:57.100
of Red China on April 21.

367
14:57.410 --> 14:59.570
It was an important anti-Japanese manifesto

368
14:59.570 --> 15:01.740
issued by the Soviet regime under the leadership

369
15:01.740 --> 15:03.410
of the Communist Party of China.

370
15:03.410 --> 15:04.680
This anti-Japanese manifesto

371
15:04.680 --> 15:07.600
is still of great significance today.

372
15:08.290 --> 15:10.120
Since the end of May this year,

373
15:10.370 --> 15:12.280
the Japanese in the Northeast

374
15:12.850 --> 15:15.410
have been continuously transferring troops through the pass.

375
15:15.410 --> 15:18.050
Their ambition for North China is known to all.

376
15:18.470 --> 15:20.050
And what about the National Government?

377
15:20.050 --> 15:22.290
Instead of taking any measures to resist Japan,

378
15:22.290 --> 15:25.450
it issued the disgraceful

379
15:25.770 --> 15:27.500
"Order to Promote Friendly Relations with Foreign Nations".

380
15:27.500 --> 15:29.340
Its compromise, surrender,

381
15:29.500 --> 15:32.290
and treasonous acts towards Japan are abundantly clear.

382
15:32.290 --> 15:33.690
This perverse act

383
15:33.900 --> 15:34.650
will inevitably arouse

384
15:34.650 --> 15:37.290
strong opposition from patriots all over the country

385
15:37.290 --> 15:39.490
and propel the anti-Japanese movement

386
15:39.650 --> 15:41.690
to a new peak.

387
15:43.900 --> 15:44.860
As for us,

388
15:45.100 --> 15:47.190
the hundreds of thousands of Nationalist troops

389
15:47.190 --> 15:48.590
pursuing our Red Army

390
15:48.610 --> 15:49.810
across the Northwest

391
15:49.900 --> 15:51.170
are now far from the cities,

392
15:51.170 --> 15:52.860
exhausted, demoralized,

393
15:53.380 --> 15:55.220
and greatly weakened in combat effectiveness.

394
15:55.220 --> 15:56.530
Xue Yue's troops in the south

395
15:56.530 --> 15:57.930
are still far away from us

396
15:58.050 --> 15:59.140
and beyond reach.

397
15:59.380 --> 16:00.500
Hu Zongnan's troops in the north

398
16:00.500 --> 16:01.760
have not yet assembled

399
16:01.770 --> 16:03.230
and are difficult to move.

400
16:03.340 --> 16:05.930
The warlord troops in Sichuan, Shaanxi, and Gansu

401
16:05.930 --> 16:07.760
are divided into complex factions and act independently.

402
16:07.760 --> 16:10.290
It is very difficult for them to coordinate operations.

403
16:10.290 --> 16:14.020
And our two main Red Army forces are about to join forces.

404
16:14.140 --> 16:15.260
After joining forces,

405
16:15.260 --> 16:17.450
we can use the vast maneuvering space

406
16:17.650 --> 16:19.140
west of the Min River as our base,

407
16:19.140 --> 16:20.870
move north swiftly at any time,

408
16:21.020 --> 16:25.690
and build up our strength across Sichuan, Shaanxi, and Gansu,

409
16:25.860 --> 16:28.520
thereby achieving our ultimate strategic goal

410
16:28.870 --> 16:30.870
of advancing north to resist Japan.

411
16:31.450 --> 16:32.500
So I think

412
16:32.690 --> 16:35.550
our strategic policy can be summed up in four words:

413
16:36.140 --> 16:38.620
Move north, resist Japan.

414
16:40.570 --> 16:43.370
Then based on Comrade Zedong's analysis just now,

415
16:43.380 --> 16:45.240
we will reply to the 4th Front Army

416
16:45.380 --> 16:47.220
to clarify our strategic policy.

417
16:47.220 --> 16:48.340
What do you all think?

418
16:48.340 --> 16:48.900
Good.

419
16:48.930 --> 16:50.020
Good, good. I agree.

420
16:50.020 --> 16:51.980
Chiang Kai-shek goes against the tide of history.

421
16:51.980 --> 16:54.340
We follow the will of heaven and the people.

422
16:54.340 --> 16:55.770
A just cause enjoys abundant support.

423
16:55.770 --> 16:59.380
Strategically, we are invincible.

424
16:59.810 --> 17:00.410
Right.

425
17:00.770 --> 17:02.100
We don't plot in secret.

426
17:02.220 --> 17:03.290
We act openly.

427
17:03.720 --> 17:06.579
We need to issue a declaration to the whole country,

428
17:06.650 --> 17:07.930
telling the people of the whole country

429
17:07.930 --> 17:11.140
our strategic policy of moving north to resist Japan,

430
17:11.380 --> 17:13.690
so that the people of the whole country will respond to us

431
17:13.690 --> 17:16.060
and fight against Japan together.

432
17:21.170 --> 17:23.540
On June 15, 1935,

433
17:24.010 --> 17:26.780
the Central Government of the Chinese Soviet Republic

434
17:26.780 --> 17:29.680
and the Revolutionary Military Commission of the Chinese Workers' and Peasants' Red Army

435
17:29.680 --> 17:30.410
issued

436
17:30.860 --> 17:33.300
the Declaration Against Japan's Annexation of North China

437
17:33.300 --> 17:35.900
and Chiang Kai-shek's Betrayal of the Nation.

438
17:35.930 --> 17:36.730
It reaffirmed

439
17:36.900 --> 17:38.680
the Provisional Central Government of the Chinese Soviet Republic's

440
17:38.680 --> 17:40.540
declaration of war against Japan

441
17:40.930 --> 17:42.930
and called on the army, navy, and air force across the country

442
17:42.930 --> 17:46.380
to join hands with the Red Army in marching north to resist Japan.

443
17:46.380 --> 17:48.210
It also called on all patriots and revolutionary people

444
17:48.210 --> 17:50.460
to rise up in protest against

445
17:50.900 --> 17:52.410
Japanese imperialism's

446
17:52.410 --> 17:53.940
occupation of North China,

447
17:54.490 --> 17:56.410
The declaration urged the people nationwide

448
17:56.410 --> 17:58.170
to mobilize and arm themselves,

449
17:58.170 --> 18:00.450
and to organize

450
18:00.450 --> 18:02.900
anti-Japanese associations, volunteer corps,

451
18:02.900 --> 18:05.900
transport units, medical teams, and propaganda teams

452
18:05.900 --> 18:09.380
to take part in the sacred war against Japan.

453
18:30.450 --> 18:31.980
According to local legend,

454
18:32.690 --> 18:35.490
As for Jiajin Mountain,

455
18:36.340 --> 18:37.740
birds cannot fly over it,

456
18:39.820 --> 18:41.420
and mortals cannot cross it.

457
18:41.730 --> 18:43.300
To cross Jiajin Mountain,

458
18:43.490 --> 18:45.690
you'd have to be a god come down to earth.

459
18:45.900 --> 18:46.930
Comrade Bocheng,

460
18:47.620 --> 18:50.060
are the preparations for crossing the snow mountain ready?

461
18:50.060 --> 18:51.060
They are all done.

462
18:51.060 --> 18:51.860
Rest assured.

463
18:52.380 --> 18:53.580
I heard from the guide

464
18:53.820 --> 18:57.170
that water freezes instantly on the mountain and the wind is strong.

465
18:57.170 --> 18:58.970
It won't be easy to cross, right?

466
19:24.930 --> 19:25.550
Bocheng.

467
19:25.970 --> 19:27.430
When crossing the Yi area,

468
19:27.490 --> 19:29.540
did you really kneel and swear brotherhood with Xiaoyedan?

469
19:29.540 --> 19:30.130
I did.

470
19:30.780 --> 19:32.690
The Yi people value loyalty.

471
19:32.900 --> 19:34.410
Only by kneeling and swearing brotherhood

472
19:34.410 --> 19:35.810
can we show our sincerity

473
19:36.010 --> 19:37.340
and earn their trust.

474
19:37.880 --> 19:39.010
Which leg did you kneel on?

475
19:39.010 --> 19:39.810
The right leg.

476
19:41.340 --> 19:42.060
Chairman,

477
19:42.780 --> 19:44.490
did I violate the rules?

478
19:45.010 --> 19:47.690
We Communists cannot yield to the enemy.

479
19:47.900 --> 19:50.170
But there is no rule against

480
19:50.380 --> 19:53.090
swearing brotherhood with the people.

481
19:53.620 --> 19:54.950
The same goes for today.

482
19:55.930 --> 19:57.390
Facing the snow mountain,

483
19:57.970 --> 19:59.250
we cannot yield,

484
19:59.820 --> 20:01.150
nor can we bow our heads.

485
20:01.690 --> 20:04.090
The snow mountain gave us a cold reception.

486
20:04.100 --> 20:05.900
So we must return a warm gift.

487
20:06.250 --> 20:07.300
What warm gift?

488
20:07.930 --> 20:08.930
Chili soup.

489
20:17.400 --> 20:18.850
It looks very spicy.

490
20:22.300 --> 20:23.300
Have a sip.

491
20:24.690 --> 20:25.250
Come on.

492
20:27.540 --> 20:28.410
Comrade Bo Gu,

493
20:28.730 --> 20:30.410
although your name means "knowing the past,"

494
20:30.410 --> 20:31.860
you must also understand the present.

495
20:31.860 --> 20:32.690
Today,

496
20:33.210 --> 20:35.140
we are going to compete with the snow mountain

497
20:35.140 --> 20:36.650
to see if it is colder

498
20:37.010 --> 20:38.100
or if we are hotter.

499
20:38.170 --> 20:38.650
Good.

500
20:38.730 --> 20:39.170
Good.

501
20:39.170 --> 20:39.690
Good.

502
20:40.580 --> 20:41.440
Serve the soup.

503
20:44.270 --> 20:44.930
Careful, it's hot.

504
20:44.930 --> 20:46.490
Alright, come on.

505
20:47.210 --> 20:48.410
Comrade Bo Gu,

506
20:48.650 --> 20:49.930
face it bravely.

507
20:50.010 --> 20:50.540
Come on.

508
20:51.620 --> 20:52.540
Come, give it to me.

509
20:52.540 --> 20:53.060
Come on.

510
21:08.860 --> 21:10.540
Jiajin Mountain!

511
21:10.780 --> 21:12.340
Here we come!

512
21:12.490 --> 21:13.380
Comrades!

513
21:14.300 --> 21:15.380
Let's go!

514
21:15.900 --> 21:16.860
Let's go!

515
23:55.860 --> 23:56.900
I can't see.

516
23:57.450 --> 23:58.490
I can't see.

517
23:58.540 --> 23:59.580
I can't see.

518
24:00.140 --> 24:01.170
I can't see.

519
24:01.900 --> 24:02.930
I can't see.

520
24:03.250 --> 24:04.300
I can't see.

521
24:06.010 --> 24:06.820
What's wrong?

522
24:07.300 --> 24:08.100
What's wrong?

523
24:08.620 --> 24:09.780
I can't see.

524
24:11.060 --> 24:12.300
Don't be afraid.

525
24:12.490 --> 24:14.090
It's called snow blindness.

526
24:14.240 --> 24:15.120
Look up.

527
24:20.650 --> 24:22.170
Listen to me.

528
24:22.690 --> 24:23.950
You will be able to see.

529
24:24.900 --> 24:27.250
Don't be afraid. Be strong.

530
24:28.000 --> 24:28.720
Help him.

531
24:29.620 --> 24:30.880
Help him walk forward.

532
24:31.190 --> 24:32.270
Walk forward.

533
24:49.930 --> 24:51.010
The generator!

534
24:51.040 --> 24:52.130
The generator.

535
24:57.100 --> 25:01.170
One, two, three!

536
25:03.450 --> 25:07.580
One, two, three!

537
25:10.950 --> 25:11.630
Let me do it.

538
25:26.770 --> 25:28.820
[Zeng Xisheng, Director of the Second Bureau, Central Revolutionary Military Commission]

539
25:35.600 --> 25:36.750
[Wei Yueqiao, Staff of the 2nd Bureau, Central Revolutionary Military Commission]

540
25:37.000 --> 25:38.830
Alright, alright.

541
25:45.620 --> 25:46.250
Go.

542
26:42.060 --> 26:47.380
[Ma Denghong, Tibetan Guide]

543
26:56.930 --> 27:03.180
♪ To be a soldier, join the Red Army ♪

544
27:03.210 --> 27:09.340
♪ After retirement, a soldier never worries about making a living ♪

545
27:09.480 --> 27:10.610
Xie.

546
27:12.170 --> 27:13.490
Xie.

547
27:14.060 --> 27:15.340
Xie.

548
27:16.780 --> 27:17.860
Xie.

549
27:19.650 --> 27:20.970
Didn't I tell you?

550
27:22.300 --> 27:23.410
No singing.

551
27:23.470 --> 27:24.670
If you sing like this,

552
27:24.990 --> 27:26.550
your lungs will burst.

553
27:27.690 --> 27:29.010
You'll lose your life.

554
27:30.410 --> 27:31.690
Chairman Mao.

555
27:31.690 --> 27:34.140
Two of my comrades sacrificed themselves.

556
27:34.580 --> 27:37.690
In the end, they wanted to hear

557
27:37.970 --> 27:40.170
songs from the Soviet Area.

558
27:40.580 --> 27:43.620
♪ To be a soldier, join the Red Army ♪

559
27:44.730 --> 27:49.860
♪ Workers and peasants welcome us everywhere ♪

560
27:49.860 --> 27:54.860
♪ Officers and soldiers stand as equals ♪

561
27:55.250 --> 27:59.690
♪ No one oppresses anyone else ♪

562
28:26.010 --> 28:26.810
Changfeng.

563
28:27.380 --> 28:27.930
Here.

564
28:28.060 --> 28:29.540
Take my horse

565
28:30.250 --> 28:31.620
to the Recuperation Company.

566
28:31.620 --> 28:33.140
They have many wounded.

567
28:33.820 --> 28:34.620
Go quickly.

568
28:34.820 --> 28:35.540
Yes.

569
28:46.960 --> 28:48.560
Everyone, unload the boxes.

570
28:49.140 --> 28:50.580
Let's share the load.

571
29:42.170 --> 29:42.970
Be careful.

572
29:46.430 --> 29:47.150
My hat!

573
29:52.720 --> 29:53.650
Don't laugh.

574
29:54.130 --> 29:55.570
Mind your discipline.

575
29:55.600 --> 29:56.860
Mind your discipline.

576
29:57.310 --> 29:58.770
Don't laugh. Don't laugh.

577
30:02.580 --> 30:03.580
Sister,

578
30:03.820 --> 30:04.860
your hat.

579
30:04.930 --> 30:06.260
Comrades, don't laugh.

580
30:07.650 --> 30:10.340
Don't laugh. Mind your discipline.

581
30:12.930 --> 30:13.660
Here,

582
30:14.060 --> 30:15.380
catch it.

583
30:26.540 --> 30:27.010
Alright.

584
30:27.010 --> 30:27.580
Don't stop.

585
30:27.580 --> 30:28.170
Go.

586
30:29.930 --> 30:31.100
Keep moving,

587
30:33.490 --> 30:34.540
or you'll freeze to death.

588
30:34.540 --> 30:34.930
Go.

589
30:35.540 --> 30:36.410
Don't stop.

590
30:38.540 --> 30:39.780
Keep moving.

591
30:40.340 --> 30:40.930
Go.

592
31:19.620 --> 31:22.410
Gou Yazi, throw the pot away.

593
31:31.130 --> 31:33.780
Gou Yazi, throw the pot away.

594
31:34.140 --> 31:35.380
Throw the pot away.

595
31:39.340 --> 31:40.380
Come out quickly.

596
31:42.220 --> 31:43.950
I told you to throw the pot away.

597
31:44.390 --> 31:45.670
Why didn't you?

598
31:46.020 --> 31:47.480
I can't throw the pot away.

599
31:48.900 --> 31:50.010
You kid,

600
31:50.580 --> 31:52.100
valuing wealth over life.

601
31:53.170 --> 31:54.820
You take after me in that.

602
31:56.820 --> 31:58.150
This broken pot of yours

603
31:58.210 --> 31:59.340
is so heavy.

604
32:19.490 --> 32:20.380
Comrade.

605
32:21.010 --> 32:22.070
You can't carry me.

606
32:22.620 --> 32:23.450
Put me down quickly.

607
32:23.450 --> 32:24.650
Political Commissar Zhong.

608
32:24.650 --> 32:25.820
Don't move.

609
32:26.340 --> 32:27.340
Put me down.

610
32:27.180 --> 32:30.310
[Zhong Chibing, Member of the Cadre Recuperation Company]

611
32:28.010 --> 32:29.010
Did you hear me?

612
32:29.410 --> 32:30.780
Put me down.

613
32:37.320 --> 32:38.920
Political Commissar Zhong.

614
32:39.060 --> 32:40.660
Political Commissar Zhong.

615
32:41.780 --> 32:42.410
Political Commissar Zhong.

616
32:42.410 --> 32:42.820
Leave me alone.

617
32:42.820 --> 32:43.340
Political Commissar Zhong.

618
32:43.340 --> 32:44.540
I can do it myself.

619
33:00.410 --> 33:01.490
Chibing.

620
33:01.900 --> 33:03.450
Zhong Chibing!

621
33:09.620 --> 33:12.480
[Li De, Military Adviser of the Communist International]

622
34:16.380 --> 34:17.489
Zhou.

623
34:18.500 --> 34:20.710
[Zhou Shidi, Section Chief of the Command Section, Senior Officers' Unit, Cadre Regiment, Military Commission Column]

624
34:19.010 --> 34:20.090
Zhou.

625
34:21.719 --> 34:23.179
Do you have any sugar left?

626
34:35.380 --> 34:36.489
A little bit.

627
34:40.480 --> 34:41.610
Not quite enough.

628
34:45.929 --> 34:46.900
Xiao.

629
34:48.900 --> 34:50.010
Xiao.

630
34:51.699 --> 34:52.900
Xiao Jinguang.

631
34:55.600 --> 34:57.080
Do you have any sugar left?

632
34:56.659 --> 35:00.380
[Xiao Jinguang, Commander of the Senior Officers' Unit, Cadre Regiment, Military Commission Column]

633
35:10.180 --> 35:11.090
That's all.

634
35:32.140 --> 35:33.260
You first.

635
35:56.820 --> 35:58.220
Delicious.

636
35:58.660 --> 36:00.050
Delicious.

637
36:00.220 --> 36:01.680
You're really something.

638
36:01.930 --> 36:03.390
You're really something.

639
36:04.300 --> 36:06.380
It really tastes like the ice cream

640
36:06.520 --> 36:08.250
from Nanjing Road in Shanghai.

641
36:09.130 --> 36:09.820
Come.

642
36:09.880 --> 36:10.480
Chen Geng.

643
36:11.480 --> 36:14.770
Is your ice cream medium rare,

644
36:15.410 --> 36:17.300
medium, or medium well?

645
36:17.610 --> 36:18.340
Xiao.

646
36:18.570 --> 36:21.180
I carefully prepared this ice cream,

647
36:21.250 --> 36:24.610
but he ate it like a steak.

648
36:26.050 --> 36:27.700
Quickly find him a medic.

649
36:28.180 --> 36:29.410
The cold's gone to his head.

650
36:29.410 --> 36:31.410
You're the one who's lost your mind.

651
36:31.570 --> 36:33.450
How could I not taste it?

652
36:33.740 --> 36:35.340
I understand everything.

653
36:35.340 --> 36:35.970
I just...

654
36:36.410 --> 36:38.900
I just wanted to bluff you, you boor.

655
36:39.030 --> 36:39.870
Zhou Shidi.

656
36:40.660 --> 36:42.860
From Whampoa till now,

657
36:43.220 --> 36:45.380
you've been a boor.

658
36:45.660 --> 36:46.860
You're the boor.

659
36:46.860 --> 36:47.700
You're a boor.

660
36:48.260 --> 36:49.090
You are.

661
36:50.410 --> 36:51.450
Erniu.

662
36:51.740 --> 36:52.820
He's just a boor.

663
36:53.220 --> 36:55.050
Pure ice cream.

664
36:58.300 --> 36:59.010
Sweet.

665
37:03.890 --> 37:05.140
Ice cream.

666
37:08.260 --> 37:09.900
So sweet. So sweet.

667
37:12.900 --> 37:13.560
Boil water.

668
37:15.700 --> 37:16.360
Boil water.

669
37:17.090 --> 37:17.750
Boil water.

670
37:18.410 --> 37:19.090
Is it sweet?

671
37:19.120 --> 37:19.640
Sweet.

672
37:29.180 --> 37:30.260
Hot.

673
37:30.660 --> 37:31.740
So hot.

674
37:32.440 --> 37:33.300
I'm burning up.

675
37:36.220 --> 37:37.300
Hot.

676
37:39.610 --> 37:40.700
I'm burning up.

677
37:44.980 --> 37:46.190
[Cai Chang, wife of Li Fuchun]

678
37:45.950 --> 37:46.970
Comrade.

679
37:47.260 --> 37:48.260
Don't take it off.

680
37:48.300 --> 37:49.260
Comrade.

681
37:49.290 --> 37:50.260
What are you doing?

682
37:50.260 --> 37:50.860
Comrade.

683
37:52.450 --> 37:53.610
Don't take it off, comrade.

684
37:52.840 --> 37:54.540
[Deng Yingchao, Committee Member of the Party General Branch of the Cadre Rest-and-Rehabilitation Company]

685
37:53.610 --> 37:54.660
Don't take it off.

686
37:54.990 --> 37:57.650
[Zhu Jixun, Red Army Warrior]

687
37:55.570 --> 37:56.190
Comrade.

688
37:56.900 --> 37:57.370
Don't take it off.

689
37:57.370 --> 37:58.000
Comrade.

690
37:57.690 --> 38:00.150
[He Zizhen, wife of Mao Zedong] [Qian Xijun, wife of Mao Zemin]

691
37:58.130 --> 37:59.010
Sister-in-law, I'll go take a look.

692
37:59.010 --> 37:59.670
Go quickly.

693
38:00.610 --> 38:02.140
Don't take it off, comrade.

694
38:02.660 --> 38:04.340
Wake up, comrade.

695
38:04.450 --> 38:05.050
Comrade.

696
38:04.510 --> 38:06.190
[Lin Boqu, Director of the Central Revolutionary Military Commission's Confiscation and Requisition Committee]

697
38:05.050 --> 38:06.820
Pat his back. Pat his back.

698
38:06.820 --> 38:07.490
Comrade.

699
38:08.410 --> 38:09.540
He has hypothermia.

700
38:09.780 --> 38:10.640
He's freezing.

701
38:10.900 --> 38:12.010
He's having hallucinations.

702
38:12.010 --> 38:13.380
Comrade, don't take it off.

703
38:13.380 --> 38:15.040
Rub him briskly to warm him up.

704
38:17.410 --> 38:17.930
Harder.

705
38:18.090 --> 38:18.570
Don't take it off.

706
38:18.400 --> 38:19.980
[Xie Juezai, Member of the Cadre Recuperation Company] [Dong Biwu, Party Secretary of the Cadre Rest and Recuperation Company]

707
38:18.570 --> 38:19.490
Pat his back hard.

708
38:19.490 --> 38:20.900
Don't take it off, comrade.

709
38:20.900 --> 38:22.180
Wake up.

710
38:22.450 --> 38:23.380
Comrade.

711
38:24.220 --> 38:25.090
What should we do?

712
38:25.090 --> 38:26.010
Comrade.

713
38:27.930 --> 38:28.740
Comrade.

714
38:28.930 --> 38:29.930
Wake up, comrade.

715
38:29.930 --> 38:31.390
Wake up, don't take it off.

716
38:33.660 --> 38:34.570
Excuse me.

717
38:34.700 --> 38:35.610
It's hot.

718
38:35.740 --> 38:36.570
It's hot.

719
38:36.570 --> 38:37.380
Put it on him.

720
38:37.510 --> 38:38.350
It's hot.

721
38:43.210 --> 38:43.960
Wake up.

722
38:43.980 --> 38:44.540
How is he?

723
38:48.040 --> 38:49.370
Are you feeling better?

724
38:49.490 --> 38:51.410
Are you feeling better, comrade?

725
38:52.490 --> 38:53.490
How are you doing?

726
38:56.900 --> 38:57.740
Comrade.

727
38:59.180 --> 39:01.450
Comrade, please write:

728
39:01.970 --> 39:05.380
by day I miss her,

729
39:05.700 --> 39:08.530
at night, I miss her, too.

730
39:09.220 --> 39:10.740
I just miss her.

731
39:11.050 --> 39:11.900
Miss her.

732
39:20.320 --> 39:22.630
Comrade.

733
39:25.850 --> 39:29.020
Comrade, comrade.

734
39:29.450 --> 39:32.450
Comrade.

735
39:33.950 --> 39:35.240
Comrade.

736
39:37.120 --> 39:38.390
Comrade.

737
39:46.930 --> 39:48.050
We should go.

738
39:49.270 --> 39:50.890
If we stay too long,

739
39:51.730 --> 39:53.770
it will be dangerous.

740
40:01.740 --> 40:02.410
Let's go.

741
40:10.180 --> 40:11.220
Hurry up.

742
40:47.000 --> 40:47.810
Let's go.

743
41:22.700 --> 41:24.100
The Jiajin Mountain Pass

744
41:24.850 --> 41:27.290
stands at an elevation of 4,114 meters.

745
41:27.460 --> 41:29.720
Perpetually cold and blanketed in snow,

746
41:29.830 --> 41:31.890
its weather can change in an instant.

747
41:32.730 --> 41:33.540
Today,

748
41:33.860 --> 41:37.180
with satellite navigation, we can measure this mountain

749
41:37.550 --> 41:39.140
without fully appreciating its dangers

750
41:39.140 --> 41:40.950
or the hardship of crossing it.

751
41:41.630 --> 41:43.890
But at that moment more than 90 years ago,

752
41:44.260 --> 41:45.470
our forebears,

753
41:45.570 --> 41:49.040
[The altitude of Queen Mother's Fortress is 4114 meters.]

754
41:45.860 --> 41:47.610
left their bloody footprints in the snow

755
41:47.610 --> 41:49.960
with their straw sandals,

756
41:50.860 --> 41:52.410
marking this place

757
41:52.410 --> 41:54.380
with their young lives.

758
41:56.570 --> 41:58.180
In their frozen fingers,

759
41:58.180 --> 42:01.030
they held the inextinguishable spark of spirit.

760
42:02.130 --> 42:04.740
Beneath their tattered uniforms beat hearts driven by

761
42:04.740 --> 42:07.330
something greater than material needs.

762
42:08.300 --> 42:09.500
On the snow mountain,

763
42:10.010 --> 42:12.530
with their own struggles and sacrifices,

764
42:12.930 --> 42:16.120
they measured the height of life and faith.

765
42:48.260 --> 42:51.070
Comrade Han Dongshan of the 4th Front Army

766
42:51.430 --> 42:53.160
is waiting for us in Dawei Town,

767
42:53.490 --> 42:55.020
at the foot of the mountain.

768
42:55.060 --> 42:58.060
There were no roads in the world to begin with.

769
42:59.260 --> 43:00.790
When many people walk on it,

770
43:01.460 --> 43:02.830
it becomes a road.
